    "truckGate": "No barrier, gate, or booth visible at any street curb cut: the west truck drive off 71st St is open (SV 2025-04, trucks rolling straight in to the SW dock pocket), the east drive serves the office/employee lots. Interior control deeper in the yard cannot be ruled out - flagged.",
